WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.940 --> 00:00:03.040
The year 2300.

2
00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:05.040
Leon's voice was a trap.

3
00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:08.080
And the Shadow spoke her name for the first time.

4
00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:09.820
23.

5
00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:13.940
AyShe, this energy signature is very familiar.

6
00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:16.920
His number was glowing in his hand.

7
00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:18.820
Someone's there.

8
00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:20.800
Red eyes.

9
00:00:26.990 --> 00:00:28.010
You're lying.

10
00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:37.520
AyShe, his energy is the same as yours. That's impossible.

11
00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:40.790
Careful! Something is moving inside the walls.

12
00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:44.840
The cave is collapsing. Everyone, fall back.

13
00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:48.960
Creatures are coming from everywhere. Don't stop.

14
00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:54.360
Crystal creatures. All of them under his command.

15
00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:57.820
This way. Trust me.

16
00:00:58.560 --> 00:01:00.420
They're behind you. Faster.

17
00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:02.920
The crystal creatures attacked.

18
00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:04.900
Run. The cave is collapsing.

19
00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:06.800
There was no escape.

20
00:01:07.360 --> 00:01:09.240
The bridge won't hold. Hurry.

21
00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:12.430
Mira, take my hand.

22
00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:15.780
The Shadow's guardian blocked the way.

23
00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:20.180
The Shadow. He put me to sleep.

24
00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:22.400
Get back. Now.

25
00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:24.780
Mira's power was awakening.

26
00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:28.260
Incredible. AyShe, how did you do that?

27
00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:31.680
The exit is up there. Follow me.

28
00:01:33.020 --> 00:01:34.700
Don't look back. Run.

29
00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:37.300
The mountain began to collapse.

30
00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:40.400
We made it. We're on the Broken Isles.

31
00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:43.300
Are you okay, AyShe?

32
00:01:47.430 --> 00:01:50.430
The mark in her palm glowed again.

33
00:01:51.030 --> 00:01:52.730
You're the real one.

34
00:01:52.990 --> 00:01:55.490
He waited 23 years to find you.

35
00:01:56.190 --> 00:01:58.170
A new path lay ahead of them.

36
00:01:58.870 --> 00:02:00.610
Can I be a copy of myself too?

37
00:02:01.450 --> 00:02:02.770
Because I'm twice as handsome.

38
00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:05.810
The four were together for the first time.

39
00:02:06.530 --> 00:02:08.630
A new signal. This time it's real.

40
00:02:09.130 --> 00:02:10.550
It's coming from the Shadow's fortress.

41
00:02:11.590 --> 00:02:15.420
AyShe, there are 22 more capsules under the fortress.

42
00:02:15.470 --> 00:02:18.690
The capsules' energy is tied to the Shadow.

43
00:02:18.890 --> 00:02:20.330
They're all under his control.

44
00:02:21.210 --> 00:02:22.770
But the signal has changed.

45
00:02:23.270 --> 00:02:25.510
Leon. Hold on. I'm coming.

46
00:02:26.130 --> 00:02:29.810
The Shadow's fortress. Where the 22 capsules are hidden.

47
00:02:30.590 --> 00:02:33.770
The corridors are empty. But too quiet.

48
00:02:34.530 --> 00:02:37.670
The fortress shields are active. We must be very careful.

49
00:02:38.370 --> 00:02:41.660
And the Shadow was waiting for them at the top of his fortress.

50
00:02:41.710 --> 00:02:45.330
Leon is in there somewhere. We'll find him.

